# Compiled GtkBuilder UI. Source is components/ui/*.xml and components/ui/settings/*.xml;
# `make` runs `xmllint --xinclude` plus tools/expand_ui_templates.py into this directory
# (row macros in the settings tabs are expanded there). The files stay tracked because
# the app loads them at runtime. jscpd reads .gitignore by default, and the shared
# CICD workflow overwrites .github/linters/.jscpd.json, so this exclusion is how those
# generated copies are left out of copy-paste detection.
d_fake_seeder/components/ui/generated/

# Translation catalogs. Parallel message files (the English source is repeated
# into every language). They stay tracked; jscpd skips them the same way it
# skips the generated UI above.
tools/translations/*.json

# translations
